  data: {
    LLM: 'Capture as many point cards as possible (10, J, Q, K, A, 2♣). Prioritize the 10♦ (2 points). Try to clear the table (Tabla) for bonus points.\n\nDo not leave cards on the table that sum to easily captured numbers (like 11-14) if opponents likely hold face cards. Save high cards to make large captures.\n\nTrack the 10♦ and 2♣. Calculate remaining points. In endgame, try to make the last capture to sweep the board.',
